  "details": "- OPP: Fix race between OPP addition and lookup {CVE-2026-74405}\n- nvmet-tcp: reject unsolicited H2CData PDUs {CVE-2026-89968}\n- drm/amdkfd: Avoid integer underflow with ffs in EOP ring size calc {CVE-2026-98176}\n- drm/dp/mst: fix buffer overflows in sideband chunk accumulation {CVE-2026-68278}\n- selinux: reject a permission value exceeding the class permission count {CVE-2026-80755}\n- rds: filter RDS_INFO_* getsockopt by caller's netns {CVE-2026-97476}\n- mm: hugetlb: fix UAF in hugetlb_handle_userfault {CVE-2022-50630}\n- sunrpc: fix one UAF issue caused by sunrpc kernel tcp socket {CVE-2024-53168}\n- net: make sock_inuse_add() available {CVE-2024-53168}\n- xfrm: fix stale skb->prev after async crypto steals a GSO segment {CVE-2026-68426}\n- esp: remove the skb from the chain when it's enqueued in cryptd_wq {CVE-2026-68426}\n- net: atlantic: eliminate double free in error handling logic {CVE-2023-52664}\n- net: atlantic: fix double free in ring reinit logic {CVE-2023-52664}\n- tun: Require CAP_NET_ADMIN to attach to an ownerless device {CVE-2026-99281}\n- vfio/pci: clear vdev->msi_perm after freeing it on init failure {CVE-2026-89777}\n- Bluetooth: bpa10x: avoid OOB read of revision string in bpa10x_setup() {CVE-2026-64549}\n- vhost/net: complete zerocopy ubufs only once {CVE-2026-74310}\n- Input: evdev - zero absinfo before partial copy in EVIOCSABS {CVE-2026-98205}\n- drm/vmwgfx: bound DMA command body size against suffix pointer {CVE-2026-74443}\n- drm/amdgpu: Bound GPIO I2C table entry count from VBIOS {CVE-2026-97493}\n- RDMA/core: fix refcount bug in iwpm_get_nlmsg_request() {CVE-2026-98252}\n- IB/IPoIB: Avoid restoring OPER_UP after multicast flush {CVE-2026-98347}\n- IB/iser: reject a remote invalidation of an unregistered direction {CVE-2026-98358}\n- vsock/vmci: validate packet source for connected sockets {CVE-2026-99122}\n- ocfs2: fix out-of-bounds write in ocfs2_write_end_inline {CVE-2026-43075}\n- inet: reject unhashed sockets during established lookups {CVE-2026-99288}\n- inet: Avoid ehash lookup race in inet_twsk_hashdance_schedule() {CVE-2026-99288}\n- inet: Avoid ehash lookup race in inet_ehash_insert() {CVE-2026-99288}\n- rculist: Add hlist_nulls_replace_rcu() and hlist_nulls_replace_init_rcu() {CVE-2026-99288}\n- rcu: Add a hlist_nulls_unhashed_lockless() function {CVE-2026-99288}",
